  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Marine habitat surveys were collected to assess nearshore marine biodiversity in the waters surrounding Arctic Bay, Nunavut, and to produce a continuous habitat map based on multibeam sonar grond-truthed with grab samples and drop video, and to evaluate the sensitivity of the biological system to landscape instability impacts, particularly sedimentation associated with natural and anthropogenic landscape instability."
